<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse and banks closed on Monday for Eid.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse and banks closed on Monday for Eid.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange and banks were closed on Monday along with business and public services for the celebration of Eid al-Fitr marking the end of the fasting month of Ramadan.</p>
</text>
